<title>USA: Dal-Tile names William Wellborn CFO.</title>
<headline>Dal-Tile names William Wellborn CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dal-Tile International Inc said on Tuesday that William (Chris) Wellborn will join the company in late August as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wellborn was previously senior vice president and chief financial officer for Lenox Inc, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Carlos Sela, the prior chief financial officer, left the company in May.</p>
<p>At the end of September, Barry Kulpa will also step down as chief operating officer.</p>
